<div class="research-entry">
  <h3>Robust Classification by Coupling Data Mollification with Label Smoothing</h3>
  <p>M. Heinonen, B.-H. Tran, M. Kampffmeyer, and M. Filippone. <em>AISTATS</em>, 2025.</p>
