<h2 id="foundation-models" class="research-section">Foundation Models</h2>

<!-- ENTRY FM-1 — figure on the left -->
<div class="research-entry">
  <h3>Zero-Shot Model-Based Reinforcement Learning using Large Language Models</h3>
  <p>A. Benechehab, Y.A. El Hili, A. Odonnat, O. Zekri, A. Thomas, G. Paolo, M. Filippone, I. Redko, and B. Kégl. <em>ICLR</em>, 2025.</p>
