  <h3>AdaPTS: Adapting Univariate Foundation Models to Probabilistic Multivariate Time Series Forecasting</h3>
  <p>A. Benechehab, V. Feofanov, G. Paolo, A. Thomas, M. Filippone, and B. Kégl. <em>Preprint</em>, 2025.</p>
