<div class="research-entry">
  <h3>Permutation-based Inference for Variational Learning of Directed Acyclic Graphs</h3>
  <p>E.V. Bonilla, P. Elinas, H. Zhao, M. Filippone, V. Kitsios, and T. O'Kane. <em>Preprint</em>, 2026.</p>
