<div class="research-entry">
  <h3>Continuous-Time Functional Diffusion Processes</h3>
  <p>G. Franzese, G. Corallo, S. Rossi, M. Heinonen, M. Filippone, and P. Michiardi. <em>NeurIPS</em>, 2023.</p>
