<div class="research-entry">
  <h3>How Much Is Enough? A Study on Diffusion Times in Score-Based Generative Models</h3>
  <p>G. Franzese, S. Rossi, L. Yang, A. Finamore, D. Rossi, M. Filippone, and P. Michiardi. <em>Entropy</em>, 25, 633, 2023.</p>
